---
permalink: /concepts/dial/index.html
station: home
seoTitle: "Voice Overs, Radio, Advertising & Commercial Production | Overnight Radio Inc."
seoDescription: "Independent production house for GREAT Radio Commercials, Jingles & Ads the very next day!"
---
<section class="tuned">
  <div class="wrap tuned__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="readout"><span class="readout__freq">{{ (stations | findBy("key", station)).freq }}</span><span class="readout__fm">FM</span><span class="readout__now">Now tuned to · London, Ontario, Canada</span></p>
      <h1 class="tuned__title">Welcome to <span>Overnight Radio Inc.</span></h1>
      <p class="tuned__lede">A commercial production house delivering top quality radio ads...<em>the very next day.</em></p>
      <div class="buttons">
        <a class="pushbtn pushbtn--lit" href="{{ cbase }}/services.html"><i></i>Learn more</a>
        <a class="pushbtn" href="{{ cbase }}/work.html"><i></i>Our Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="speaker" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="speaker__cone"><span class="speaker__cap">{% include "mark.njk" %}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="meters">
  <div class="wrap meters__grid">
    {% set g = { k: "Founded in", v: "1998", angle: -10 } %}{% include "concepts/dial/gauge.njk" %}
    {% set g = { k: "Over", v: "50,000", sub: "spots delivered", angle: 38 } %}{% include "concepts/dial/gauge.njk" %}
    {% set g = { k: "Servicing clients", v: "around the world ...", sub: "From North America to Europe ... And Australia to Asia", angle: 22 } %}{% include "concepts/dial/gauge.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel-sec">
  <div class="wrap grille-split">
    <div class="grille" aria-hidden="true"><span class="grille__badge">Overnight Radio</span></div>
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="silk">Owner's manual · Section 1</p>
      <h2 class="h2">What Overnight Radio Can Do For You</h2>
      <p class="lead">Whether you’re a radio station, a media group, a podcaster, steaming audio productions, or a private business, we can be of service to you... for commercial voice overs, radio commercial production and radio commercial scripts.</p>
      <p>We serve clients all over the world, from Toronto to Miami to Vancouver, the Caribbean, Europe to Dubai. We can provide you high quality radio ads. All produced from our studios in London, Canada, west of Toronto.</p>
      <p>Since 1998, Overnight Radio has been delivering high end commercial productions.</p>
      <p>We help stations have more commercial voice overs to choose from, expand station creative departments by providing commercial script writing and production... all for much less than adding staff, paying benefits, etc.</p>
      <p>And we help businesses looking for a sound that will cut through the radio waves... working directly to create effective radio commercials that will make you well known in your market.</p>
      <p>Anything to do with creating a radio commercial... we are your team... we’ve been honing our talents for more than two decades.</p>
      <p class="callout">For radio commercial production, scripts and voice overs... put our experience and low rates to work for you. <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">Call</a> or <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">email</a> today.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="presets-sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="silk">Presets</p>
    <div class="presets">
      {% for s in stations %}{% if s.key != "home" %}
      <a class="preset" href="{{ cbase }}{{ s.path }}"><span class="preset__n">{{ loop.index0 }}</span><span class="preset__l">{{ s.label }}</span><span class="preset__f">{{ s.freq }} FM</span></a>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
